<title>JAPAN: Japan offers 1 trln yen in 2.7 pct 10-year bonds.</title>
<headline>Japan offers 1 trln yen in 2.7 pct 10-year bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Thursday it was offering one trillion yen in 2.7 pct 10-year bonds through an auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be January 27 and the maturity date will be March 20, 2007.</p>
